WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.400
LYNX SHARE has instruments of its own. Here is a melody on the Synth channel.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.800
Load LYNX Model, a physical model of mallets, bars and tines.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.400
It starts as a marimba. Pick another model, like the kalimba.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:25.200
Drag the strike point, or turn Hardness, to change the tone while it plays.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:30.800
Helix is LYNX's wavetable synth. Load it on the same channel.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.600
Turn the wavetable position to sweep through its waves.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:42.200
Tetra, Braid and every other instrument are in the Add menu.
